    "name": "Grand Hotel Lviv Casino & Spa",
    "hotelDescription": "<p><strong>Luxurious Accommodation</strong><br>The Grand Hotel in the heart of Lviv offers a blend of modern comfort and classical charm. Each guest room is equipped with air conditioning, a minibar, and satellite TV, ensuring a luxurious stay for all visitors.</p><p><strong>Gourmet Dining Experience</strong><br>Start your day with a delicious buffet breakfast included in your room rate, and indulge in a full menu at the elegant GrandSoLie restaurant. Whether you're craving a hearty meal or a light snack, the hotel's dining options are sure to satisfy your taste buds.</p><p><strong>Relaxation ",
